      "content": "okay, i'll try the advil. i've actually been feeling a little lightheaded and dizzy when i stand up too fast lately, maybe because i'm not eating much due to the stomach pain? and since you mentioned the advil helps with inflammation, would it be safe to take a stronger dose, like 800mg or even 1000mg at one time, if the back pain gets really sharp? i'd really rather just manage this at home and avoid a trip to the doctor if i can.",
